  "details": "With world pages now featuring tabs to separate the world details and the world author, what about adding another tab for users to submit feedback directly to the world author in the client? This new tab, possibly titled \"World Feedback,\" could function as a comment section where users leave feedback on a world. Feedback could be sorted by options such as \"Most Liked,\" \"Most Recent,\" or \"Oldest.\"\n\nThis feature would be highly useful, as many world creators currently lack an easy way for users to provide feedback on their creations.\n\nI could see it going hand-in-hand with this request also.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/world-ranking-system",
